    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They are coming...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Tommy, a 9 year old boy who finds himself in a mysterious video game club from the 1990s. Your only goal is to enjoy the arcade machines and have fun But something strange is waiting for you here... Something far beyond what Tommy has ever experienced...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/3a03631b7a960432ce855c3dce155d21.poster.avif?t=1755344986\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/3a03631b7a960432ce855c3dce155d21.webm?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/3a03631b7a960432ce855c3dce155d21.mp4?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird noises echo around you, and to escape this nightmare, you must enter a strange video game. This game not only challenges you with 2D platforming obstacles but also forces you to solve complex puzzles and face the deepest fears within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/87399fc7d103c71f37b985a7a124ae73.poster.avif?t=1755344986\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/87399fc7d103c71f37b985a7a124ae73.webm?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/87399fc7d103c71f37b985a7a124ae73.mp4?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With captivating 3D realistic graphics and a gripping storyline, <strong>THEM</strong> blends first-person Psychological Creepy with retro 2D-Platformer gameplay, creating a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/1d8544d53083c6784b5d11ca00fceddf.poster.avif?t=1755344986\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/1d8544d53083c6784b5d11ca00fceddf.webm?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/1d8544d53083c6784b5d11ca00fceddf.mp4?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A short video game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 First-person gameplay + 2D platforming elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A deep and captivating story with unexpected twists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Engaging and mysterious 3D environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Find Hidden objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Diverse Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple Endings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>THEM</strong> and see if you can escape this nightmare or will you become a part of them!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They are coming...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Tommy, a 9 year old boy who finds himself in a mysterious video game club from the 1990s. Your only goal is to enjoy the arcade machines and have fun But something strange is waiting for you here... Something far beyond what Tommy has ever experienced...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/3a03631b7a960432ce855c3dce155d21.poster.avif?t=1755344986\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/3a03631b7a960432ce855c3dce155d21.webm?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/3a03631b7a960432ce855c3dce155d21.mp4?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird noises echo around you, and to escape this nightmare, you must enter a strange video game. This game not only challenges you with 2D platforming obstacles but also forces you to solve complex puzzles and face the deepest fears within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/87399fc7d103c71f37b985a7a124ae73.poster.avif?t=1755344986\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/87399fc7d103c71f37b985a7a124ae73.webm?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/87399fc7d103c71f37b985a7a124ae73.mp4?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With captivating 3D realistic graphics and a gripping storyline, <strong>THEM</strong> blends first-person Psychological Creepy with retro 2D-Platformer gameplay, creating a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/1d8544d53083c6784b5d11ca00fceddf.poster.avif?t=1755344986\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/1d8544d53083c6784b5d11ca00fceddf.webm?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/1d8544d53083c6784b5d11ca00fceddf.mp4?t=1755344986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A short video game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 First-person gameplay + 2D platforming elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A deep and captivating story with unexpected twists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Engaging and mysterious 3D environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Find Hidden objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Diverse Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple Endings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>THEM</strong> and see if you can escape this nightmare or will you become a part of them!</p>",
    "short_description": "You just want to play a video game in an old game club, but time passes quickly, and strange noises draw you into a dark nightmare! A nightmare that begins with an old video game... Are you ready to experience a 2d platformer game within the heart of a first person psychological creepy game?",
